      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Bottega Veneta's newly launched Nodo shoulder bag is both refined and ingenious, featuring a slim, compact hobo silhouette. Its standout feature is the body crafted from warm, supple Italian brown suede, with the sides and base spliced with Intrecciato woven leather. The short shoulder strap is made from glossy calfskin, and a leather knot adorns the side, showcasing the artisan's playful mix of materials.",
